Package: linux@source_suffix@-headers-@abiname@@localversion@
Meta-Rules-Target: headers
Meta-Rules-Makeflags: INSTALLDOCS_LINK_DOC=linux@source_suffix@-base-@abiname@@localversion@
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel>
Depends:
 linux-base (>= 4.12~),
 linux@source_suffix@-base-@abiname@@localversion@ (= ${binary:Version}),
 linux@source_suffix@-headers-@abiname@-common@localversion_headers@ (= ${source:Version}),
 linux-kbuild-@abiname@,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Header files for Linux @abiname@@localversion@
 This package provides the architecture-specific kernel header files
 for Linux kernel @abiname@@localversion@, generally
 used for building out-of-tree kernel modules. These files are going to be
 installed into /usr/src/linux@source_suffix@-headers-@abiname@@localversion@, and can
 be used for building modules that load into the kernel provided by the
 linux@source_suffix@-image-@abiname@@localversion@ package.
